// The Gap 3.1 sensitive-header allowlist MEMBERSHIP test was moved in-crate
// (see `src/default_api_client.rs`'s `#[cfg(test)] mod tests`) because
// `SENSITIVE_HEADER_NAMES` lives in the crate-private `default_api_client`
